          </div>

          <!-- Privacy Guarantee Box -->
          <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xs space-y-2.5 text-xs">
            <div class="font-bold text-foreground flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
              <span>🛡️</span>
              <span>100% Client-Side Privacy</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Your signature never touches an external server. It is rendered directly in your browser's local memory using HTML5 Canvas. No sign-up, no analytics tracking on your name, and no image storage.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Official Exam Guidelines Box -->
          <div class="bg-card border border-border rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-xs space-y-3 text-xs">
